name 'designing-reliable-apps-preassessment-q3_2025'

question 'Which scenario best describes synchronous code execution?'

right 'A program pauses entirely and waits for a video to finish downloading before running any other code'
wrong 'A streaming app keeps playing music while downloading the next song in the background'
wrong 'A web page displays a loading spinner while content is still arriving from the server'
wrong 'An app sends multiple API requests at the same time to load a page faster'

allow_multiple_attempts true

